{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10241070","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10241070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1024107001:0":{"text":"안녕하세요, 아가씨. 혹시 검은 오리에 대해 알고 있는 게 있나요?","source_cn":"这位优雅端庄的小姐，您能告诉我一些关于黑鸭的可贵情报吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF75268C58D22078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1024107002:0":{"text":"어머, 정말 정중하신 분이네요! ","source_cn":"呀~小哥真是客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE5BC82F42E9F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024107003:0":{"text":"그 망할... 흠흠! 이상한 오리가 우리 집 거위 우리 밖을 계속 서성거리고 있었어요.","source_cn":"那只该死的——咳嗯，奇怪的黑鸭子，总是在我的鹅圈外踱步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA11E7E1EFF681BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1024107004:0":{"text":"어젯밤에는 거위를 보고 울어 젖히는 바람에 우리 거위들이 다 도망갔다고요!","source_cn":"昨天晚上，它对着鹅群叫了几声，然后我含辛茹苦养大的白鹅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4445628EEC226C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1024107005:0":{"text":"저뿐만 아니라 <style=\"highlight\">미스릴 상회 사람들</style>도 봤어요! ","source_cn":"不只是我，<style=highlight>秘银商会的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AE04F47D1ACF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1024107006:0":{"text":"죄송합니다. 미스릴 상회에서 배상할게요! ","source_cn":"真是对不起，秘银商会一定会赔偿您的损失，请笑纳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931B114BA7A50178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1024107007:0":{"text":"그러면 거위 우리, 아니... 집이 어디 신가요?","source_cn":"那么，您的鹅圈——不，您的府邸，在哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF538E80FFF6D9116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1024107008:0":{"text":"성석 마을 서쪽에 있어요.","source_cn":"我家就在圣石镇西边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC321D85968D25993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1024107009:0":{"text":"저기, 그런데요. 당신은 어디 살아요? 제 주소도 알려 줬는데, 따로 만나는 건 어때요?","source_cn":"话说小哥，你住哪里？我都把住址告诉你了，咱们以后可以多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD157ED6B034CF6FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1024107010:0":{"text":"...아, 감사하지만 지금은 바빠서요. 나중에 꼭 알려드리죠!","source_cn":"——感谢小姐垂青，我还有事要忙，之后一定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF83CF251FED5E9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:养鹅的农妇":{"text":"거위 농장 주인","source":"养鹅的农妇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"로완","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":3}}